ed combat, customizable party development, and branching narratives that shift with player choices.\nThe remaster sharpens the original\u2019s impressionist watercolor visuals to higher resolution, rebuilds the UI for smoother play, and adds new events and playable characters that expand Sandail\u2019s stories. New systems include Parameter Inheritance for deeper stat customization, enhanced boss encounters for tougher challenges, recruitable diggers who can return with expedition loot, plus quality-of-life additions like high-speed modes and New Game+.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/saga-frontier-2-remastered", "videos": [{"id": 144441, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "wyv8tOYlum0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyv8tOYlum0", "title": "SaGa Frontier 2 Remastered \u2013 Launch Trailer \u2013 Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wyv8tOYlum0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 175569, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "hb73E63qG_k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hb73E63qG_k", "title": "SaGa Frontier 2 Remastered | Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hb73E63qG_k/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 175570, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "0C4sBzSM2Iw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0C4sBzSM2Iw", "title": "SaGa Frontier 2 Remastered - Official Opening Movie Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0C4sBzSM2Iw/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1510, "name": "SaGa Frontier"}, {"id": 88, "name": "SaGa"}]}